# The pause screen (RaceStateMachine_Update) in a one-player race, and the screens it opens, then a retirement from
# it, which ends the race (docs/port/SYNTH.md 2). Its menu: 0 resume, 1-4 the options, controls, video and audio
# screens (pause states 5, 4, 2, 3), 5, 6 restart, 7 quit (pause state 8, confirmed with LEFT/RIGHT and A).
# until: 0x800000:60
# seconds: 120
# expect: state=0x00800000: players 1, windows 1, cars 6, mode 0, track 0, pause 0
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen
17 A           # the mode screen: a single race
20 A           # the track select
23 A           # the car select; the race from 23.6 s, its countdown to 27 s
30 START       # pause
31 DOWN 0.1    # its second item
32 A           # the screen it opens
35 B           # back to the pause menu
36 DOWN 0.1    # the third item
37 A
40 B
41 DOWN 0.1    # the fourth
42 A
45 B
46 DOWN 0.1    # the fifth
47 A
50 B
51 DOWN 0.1    # down to quit (item 7)
51.5 DOWN 0.1
52 DOWN 0.1
53 A           # quit: are you sure?
54 RIGHT 0.1   # yes
55 A           # the race is retired: _EndGame, the results, the game over screen
